{
  "id": "02-the-new-adam",
  "title": "Life in the New Adam",
  "tenet": "Become more like Christ",
  "durationMs": 42624,
  "audioAsset": "kingdom/02-the-new-adam.mp3",
  "transcriptAsset": "assets/kingdom/02-the-new-adam.json",
  "text": "A girl heard her friend say, I thought I could never change. Then she saw that friend forgive someone who had hurt her. The change was not a performance. It was a new way of living. Christ is the new Adam. In him, we are invited beyond the old pattern of hiding, blaming, and grasping. We receive mercy, and learn to tell the truth. We receive love, and learn to give it. We are not made new by a single impressive moment. We abide in Jesus, repent when we fall, and begin again. Name a pattern you want to leave behind. Name the Christlike response you want to practice instead. Today, choose that response for one real person.",
